Input: {"question": "Which sports team does Stefan Zinnow represent or represent?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 79, "text": "Title: The Frankfurt Connection: Stefan Zinnow's Journey to Eintracht Frankfurt"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 81, "end": 235, "text": "In the heart of Frankfurt, a city steeped in history and tradition, a young German footballer named Stefan Zinnow was making waves in the world of sports."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 236, "end": 357, "text": "With a passion that burned brighter than the city's iconic Römerberg square, Stefan's talent on the pitch was undeniable."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 358, "end": 510, "text": "But it was his affiliation with one of Germany's most beloved clubs, Eintracht Frankfurt, that would cement his place in the annals of football history."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 511, "end": 670, "text": "As we delve into the life of Stefan Zinnow, we find ourselves in the midst of a bustling metropolis, where the Main River flows gently through the city's core."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 671, "end": 757, "text": "It is here, in the Hesse region of Germany, that Eintracht Frankfurt was born in 1899."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 758, "end": 883, "text": "The club's rich heritage is woven into the fabric of the city, with its iconic eagle emblem a symbol of pride and resilience."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 884, "end": 1001, "text": "Stefan's journey to Eintracht Frankfurt began like many young footballers, with a dream to play at the highest level."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1002, "end": 1136, "text": "Growing up in Germany, he was surrounded by the beautiful game, and his natural ability was nurtured by dedicated coaches and